      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been reading a lot about the stuff with trans athletes in sports lately and it's honestly so confusing. everyone seems to have a different version of what the 'fairness' argument actually is. can you just lay out what's actually going on? like, what are the core reasons people say it's unfair vs why people say it should be allowed?",
