    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get that, but it feels like you're just repeating the talking points from both sides. Like, you said identity is a \"fundamental human right\" but you didn't really explain why that should take precedence over the physical reality of the competition. If someone has a biological advantage, isn't the \"fairness\" side just a matter of fact rather than an \"argument\"?",
